      "summary": "This bill directs the Interior Secretary to award, for seven fiscal years after enactment, a grant to the National Law Enforcement Officers Memorial Fund to support the National Law Enforcement Museum's outreach, education, and officer safety and wellness programs. Funds may pay for memorializing line\u2011of\u2011duty deaths, compiling fatality data, exhibits, collections and research, and trainings for Federal, State, local, tribal law enforcement and the public."
