      "summary": "The bill directs the Secretary of the Interior to award grants to the National Law Enforcement Officers Memorial Fund to support outreach, public education, and officer safety and wellness programs at the National Law Enforcement Museum for seven fiscal years. It affects the Memorial Fund and the National Law Enforcement Museum in Washington, D.C., and federal, tribal, state, and local law enforcement agencies that use the museum's programs."
